### Admin Home Page
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/

### Products Page
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products


### Create Single Product
POST http://localhost:3000/admin/products/addaproduct
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "itemName": "Apple",
  "itemPrice": 100,
  "itemDesc": "This is an apple"
}


### Create Many Products
POST http://localhost:3000/admin/products/createmany
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "itemName": "Mango", "itemPrice": 80, "itemDesc": "Juicy tropical fruit rich in vitamin A and C." },
  { "itemName": "Orange", "itemPrice": 60, "itemDesc": "Citrus fruit known for its tangy flavor and vitamin C." },
  { "itemName": "Banana", "itemPrice": 40, "itemDesc": "Energy-rich fruit high in potassium and fiber." },
  { "itemName": "Apple", "itemPrice": 100, "itemDesc": "Crisp and sweet fruit that's great for heart health." },
  { "itemName": "Pineapple", "itemPrice": 90, "itemDesc": "Tropical fruit with a sweet and tangy flavor, great for digestion." },
  { "itemName": "Watermelon", "itemPrice": 120, "itemDesc": "Refreshing summer fruit with high water content." },
  { "itemName": "Papaya", "itemPrice": 70, "itemDesc": "Soft and tropical fruit known to aid digestion." },
  { "itemName": "Grapes", "itemPrice": 50, "itemDesc": "Small, sweet fruits high in antioxidants." },
  { "itemName": "Strawberry", "itemPrice": 110, "itemDesc": "Bright red, sweet berries rich in vitamin C and fiber." },
  { "itemName": "Guava", "itemPrice": 55, "itemDesc": "Tropical fruit packed with fiber, vitamin C, and antioxidants." }
]


### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/getallproducts


### Find One Product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/findone/68433a181ed8a5606163ff5a


### Find by Item Name
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/byname/apple


### Price Less Than
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/pricelt/100

### Price Less Than or Equal
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/pricelte/100

### Price Greater Than
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/pricegt/100

### Price Greater Than or Equal
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/pricegte/100

### Price Equal
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/priceeq/100

### Price Not Equal
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/priceneq/100


### Find Products (Includes)
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/findProducts/includes/apple

### Find Products (Not Includes)
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/findProducts/notincludes/apple

### Starts With
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/findProducts/startswith/app

### Ends With
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/findProducts/endswith/ple

### Not Starts With
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/findProducts/notstartswith/app

### Not Ends With
GET http://localhost:3000/admin/products/findProducts/notendswith/ple


